    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/0a7e6fbd623187a4f0e0444690e5d25d.poster.avif?t=1718004158\" width=628 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/0a7e6fbd623187a4f0e0444690e5d25d.webm?t=1718004158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/0a7e6fbd623187a4f0e0444690e5d25d.mp4?t=1718004158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Cat Warroir</strong> is an action-platformer of retro and cute style about a cat knight on his way to recapture his stolen treasure.<br>Deep into the exciting and dangerous fantasy world,defeat the challenging big boss with your slash, dash, jump, walljump and other skills to find the treasure back!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Addictive gameplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compete with players from all over the world in BossRush mode</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 unique challenge worldsand 30 handmade levels.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful pixel-art graphics;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A cute cat</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/775c860f81b93396cad23c783853e59f.poster.avif?t=1718004158\" width=632 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/775c860f81b93396cad23c783853e59f.webm?t=1718004158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640520/extras/775c860f81b93396cad23c783853e59f.mp4?t=1718004158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
